<title>UK: LIFFE certified coffee stocks rise to 2,104 lots.</title>
<headline>LIFFE certified coffee stocks rise to 2,104 lots.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>London International Financial Futures and Options Exchange (LIFFE) certified coffee stocks rose to 2,104 five-tonne lots in November from 1,410 lots in October, traders said on Monday.</p>
<p>There was no immediate confirmation from LIFFE.</p>
<p>Traders said the stock increase was within earlier market expectation. -- Jalil Hamid, London newsroom +44 171 542 4985</p>
